WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:24.498
One morning Bird was drawing.

2
00:00:24.499 --> 00:00:27.645
"What are you doing?" asked Kip.

3
00:00:27.646 --> 00:00:31.544
"I'm drawing a bird," said Bird.

4
00:00:31.545 --> 00:00:37.713
"Wow," said Kip.

5
00:00:37.714 --> 00:00:40.741
"I didn't know you like to draw."

6
00:00:40.742 --> 00:00:48.298
"Oh, I love to draw," said Bird.

7
00:00:48.299 --> 00:00:54.641
"You're very good at it," said Kip.

8
00:00:54.642 --> 00:00:59.529
"I wish I was good at something."

9
00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:05.186
"You're good at something," said Bird.

10
00:01:05.187 --> 00:01:07.948
"You're good at cooking.

11
00:01:07.949 --> 00:01:12.795
You made that yummy acorn gumbo."

12
00:01:12.796 --> 00:01:16.721
"But it smelled bad," said Kip.

13
00:01:16.722 --> 00:01:20.179
"So I'm not that good at cooking.

14
00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.884
I wish I was very good at something."

15
00:01:23.885 --> 00:01:34.617
"There must be something," said Bird.

16
00:01:34.618 --> 00:01:40.819
Kip tried to think of something.

17
00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:47.102
He thought and thought.

18
00:01:47.103 --> 00:01:52.183
At last he had an idea.

19
00:01:52.184 --> 00:01:55.094
"I know, Bird!" said Kip.

20
00:01:55.095 --> 00:02:02.689
"Watch this!"

21
00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:07.137
"What are you doing?" asked Bird.

22
00:02:07.138 --> 00:02:10.616
"I'm standing on my head!" said Kip.

23
00:02:10.617 --> 00:02:18.506
"I'm going to be very good at it!"
